CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'cryp->payload_in < AES_BLOCK_SIZE'
#956: FILE: drivers/crypto/stm32/stm32-cryp.c:1456:
+	if (unlikely((cryp->payload_in < AES_BLOCK_SIZE) &&
